### Opret en ejendom
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ejendom
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vejnavn": "Nordre Fasanvej",
  "husnummer": "215",
  "postnummer": "2000",
  "bynavn": "Frederiksberg",
  "bbrId": "0a3f50c8-f7ed-32b8-e044-0003ba298018",
  "ejendomstype": "Etageboligbebyggelse (flerfamiliehus)",
  "byggeaar": 1930,
  "boligareal": 72,
  "antalVaerelser": 3,
  "grundareal": 0
}

### Opret en investeringscase
POST http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ejendomId": 1,
  "navn": "Plan A",
  "beskrivelse": "Test case"
}

### Gem finansiering for en case (upsert)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/finansiering
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": 1,
  "laanebeloeb": 2000000,
  "rentePct": 4,
  "loebetidAar": 30,
  "afdragsfriAar": 0,
  "laanetype": "fastforrentet"
}

### Tilføj en koebsomkostning
POST http://localhost:3000/api/koebsomkostning
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": 1,
  "beskrivelse": "Ejendomspris",
  "beloeb": 2500000
}

### Tilføj en renovering
POST http://localhost:3000/api/renovering
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": 1,
  "beskrivelse": "Køkken renovering",
  "beloeb": 150000,
  "år": 5
}

### Tilføj en driftsudgift
POST http://localhost:3000/api/driftsudgift
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": 1,
  "navn": "Forsikring",
  "beloebMaaned": 500
}

### Gem udlejning for en case (upsert)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/udlejning
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": 1,
  "maanedligLeje": 8000,
  "maanedligUdgift": 500
}

### Duplikér en case (kopierer alle linjer over)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/investment-cases/1/duplicate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Kør 30-års simulation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/simulation/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanAmount": 2000000,
  "initialEquity": 500000,
  "interestRate": 0.04,
  "annualRepayment": 66667,
  "rent": 15000,
  "expenses": 1500,
  "years": 30
}
